From 60332484fe212d7d7503507bff7b7f627a607c51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mandrigin <igor@gateway.fm>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 21:15:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/26] local(arm64): native pins for LEZ services/r0vm
 rebuilds, official Core aarch64 archive, LEZ_SKIP_TESTS lanes

- sequencer/indexer/r0vm sha256 pins -> native aarch64 rebuilds from the
  same pinned sources (v0.2.0 a58fbce, rust 1.94.0; r0vm from the risc0
  v3.0.5 tag, no arm64-linux release asset exists)
- bitcoin provenance.env -> the official 31.1 aarch64 archive (hash from
  the same signed SHA256SUMS / guix attestation set)
- verify-lez-v02-provisional: LEZ_SKIP_TESTS=1 keeps every artifact
  digest/ImageID assertion, skips host-arch test gates and builds
  methods/deployer without executing tests
---
 scripts/run-lez-v02-stack.sh                   |  6 +++---
 scripts/verify-lez-v02-local-stack-contract.sh | 10 +++++-----
 scripts/verify-lez-v02-provisional.sh          | 16 +++++++++++++++-
 tests/e2e/bitcoin-core/provenance.env          |  8 ++++----
 4 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

